                    Transcribed by Bernau.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d144-f2" n="2" xml:id="d144-f2-content">
                <p>For text of Eisenhower’s draft message to Eden, see <ref
                        target="frus1955-57v16#pg_874">vol. XVI, p. 874</ref>. The message was not
                    sent.</p>
            </note>
